{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><strong>Rotate the rooms:</strong> Pivot chambers to <strong>rearrange the pyramid</strong>, open <strong>new passages</strong>, and reach unexplored areas. Each rotation can reveal a secret\u2026 or block your way. Can you find the right combination?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/bb128255f0ba876d6c023d3030746875.poster.avif?t=1768644405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/bb128255f0ba876d6c023d3030746875.webm?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/bb128255f0ba876d6c023d3030746875.mp4?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve optional puzzles</h2>For the boldest explorers, tackle <strong>optional challenges</strong> and unlock <strong>secret puzzles</strong> hidden in the pyramid. Your observation and logic will be put to the test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/302aa0856706edf015c23c94fa252a79.poster.avif?t=1768644405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/302aa0856706edf015c23c94fa252a79.webm?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/302aa0856706edf015c23c94fa252a79.mp4?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/26adf09547af1689b9046e920ebecf13.poster.avif?t=1768644405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/26adf09547af1689b9046e920ebecf13.webm?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/26adf09547af1689b9046e920ebecf13.mp4?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/23ed2ce9e00f661bf198b258362fb99b.poster.avif?t=1768644405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/23ed2ce9e00f661bf198b258362fb99b.webm?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/23ed2ce9e00f661bf198b258362fb99b.mp4?t=1768644405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>In <strong>Hamstermind</strong>, you play the legendary <strong>Hamster Jones</strong>, a fearless explorer accompanied by his quirky team. Trapped in the <strong>ancient pyramid of Charaon</strong>, your mission is to <strong>solve complex enigmas</strong> to uncover the mysteries of this sacred place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/60c6cb81a925b901960864737e4e03c2.avif?t=1768644405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras_big/60c6cb81a925b901960864737e4e03c2.webp?t=1768644405 width=1560 height=756 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2>Collect <strong>unique artifacts</strong> and note your discoveries in your journal to <strong>unravel the mystery</strong> surrounding this forgotten site. Every clue is a piece of the puzzle lead